mw2coop patch for maps/_friendlyfire.gsc (Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Outside a co-op campaign session the change does nothing (maps\_mw2coop::ff_note returns).

1. A player's damage to a friendly or a civilian is noted for the log: when the mission fails for
   friendly fire, the log says who hurt or killed whom with what (a player's log, 2026-11-26:
   Cliffhanger failed for friendly fire three times right after its start, with nothing to show
   what was hit).
@@@ subst friendly_fire_think
		friendly_fire_checkPoints( civilianKilled );
@@@ to
		maps\_mw2coop::ff_note( entity, attacker, damage, method, weaponName, killed );
		friendly_fire_checkPoints( civilianKilled );
@@@ end
